# Arch tooling root for installing from a non-Arch rescue system (OVH = Debian).
# Unpacked on the rescue host, chrooted into, then `appsynergy-install` runs from
# inside it. Every binary the installer requires via cmd::need() must be here, or
# the failure only surfaces after the operator has already committed to the wipe.
base
arch-install-scripts
# installer hard requirements (cmd::need list in main.rs)
gptfdisk
cryptsetup
dosfstools
btrfs-progs
efibootmgr
util-linux
systemd
# LUKS enrollment + initramfs work performed inside the target chroot
tpm2-tools
mkinitcpio
